# Festag — dark-mode CTAs

Foundation: Festag primary slate **`#5B647D`** (Google button). Clean pills, quiet idle, slate ready.

## Geometry

```css
border-radius: 999px;
```

## Idle / secondary (dark)

```css
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
color: #C4C8D4;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
```

## Ready / primary (dark)

```css
background: #5B647D; /* --festag-btn-ready-bg / Google CTA */
color: #FFFFFF;
border: 1px solid transparent;
box-shadow: none;
```

Hover `#6A738C` / active `#4A5368`. Ghost / secondary stay idle.

## Light mode

Generic CTAs stay white/light (`festag-light-mode-ctas`). Execution `/dev/login` light **Anmelden** may use success green `#2E9B52` when enabled — dark Execution uses primary slate.

## Do not

- Forest green as dark ready / primary fills
- Neon blues (`#295CFF`) as CTA fills
- Colored glow shadows
- Force `--ready` on empty / incomplete fields
